<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-12T07:34:09.383Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:34:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits ambushed army-escorted traders in Zamfara, leaving 22 feared dead, while suspected bandits killed a vigilante member in Plateau and fled as troops arrived. ISWAP fighters attacked a town in Borno and were repelled, with 25 terrorists killed. Survivors in Zamfara reported needing blood after terrorists killed eight security operatives and 19 civilians. HURIWA is urging President Tinubu to rescue 80 abducted schoolchildren in Borno. Nigeria condemned the Houthi strike on King Khalid International Airport that killed 12 and injured over 300. The conflict caused 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNaTBWT2haWWZZWTRqSVplNzR4dkgtTW1zazd1eTRBbF9vSG5NVVZvcWNhN3ppSi1faHFaLWVmcEZzRDZFdTBZTHFweTJLSDFHaENza0FXQmNzNmViMHJsWkdaNmYyQWJXRmtGMUt2SkJRelVuTVYxOWJvQUkzNlJ0OHhpdm5NVXBWQ3gtNmJMTFAzd1Fmbm1iUFRHYVdadVR1?oc=5&quot;&gt;ThePointNG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPZ0xFMll6Smkxb3dRUE1kRF94dGgxQnAzc2c0RnN6bDduSEtjcHVjVXR2WXkwSEc2eEdlZWFEZExDdEltbjhvb0pEVG9SMm1UV0QwMDFoRnlZQ0FlNXZVRnozZkdhN2VyM0xhdDlwSG5MaFh6OV9WS1pNSjNNMHcxamIyelBpS0RYVVYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPSWRPWnJ5THYtMDFJa2dRTEU0OVdSbW9tUXhCWmZpVjdadEFjYjhCTDdidWJ5ZDFKQjIwWk8zdWFiVkIxb29ER2lBYkkxdHY1OF93REZUZDByanQ2UnRxRm9xQlJmRlVjZnRYTWVMcjdWMlJpVmJBX0FrcThWS1ZQeWZwZldsd0ZYUGt0TEZobjhjbjEzSUJRZFFwSjBnV0wwRHA2THhXMEptVWJVb1MxR1JfeWlKN3h1cWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Premium Times Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQTklMU2FsVGkxMUg3WVU4UnZZaEZlSmEtcFJhQS1WVjRPWk9XbEduVlNTdXVSaDBZQ0lwZDlSdHdHakNNLVNnOEw5Q0luLUEtZUlCaXBYSWYxcXFQVTRRVkRWV2Q3SXAzRlg0UUN0TElMR3ZMU1ViSVlmOU1XT1hnbDBQbWJ6TnJTNDExdVJ